Yeah, yeah, it's fantastic And his walk just his walk across that cafe like his is just So specific and weird and different just showed he revolutionized his entire personality Like, there wasn't a thing about himself that he didn't throw out and start over again as New Barney.
对，对，太棒了。还有他走路的姿势，他穿过那家咖啡馆的步态，那么独特、怪异又与众不同，简直表明他彻底重塑了自己的整个个性。他身上没有任何一个部分是没有被抛弃并作为“新巴尼”重新开始的。

